---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { offers, contact } from '@config/site';
---
<Base title="Competitive Response Sprint" description="Turn verified competitive intelligence into battlecards, pricing responses, positioning, messaging and market action." path="/strategic-blueprint/">
  <section class="rsp-final__hero" data-surface="dark"><div class="container-wide rsp-final__hero-grid"><div><span class="label">COMPETITIVE RESPONSE SPRINT</span><h1>Turn the decision into a competitive response.</h1><p>When the intelligence is clear but the response is not, Evidence Axis converts the decision into the sales, pricing, positioning and messaging assets the team needs to act.</p><div class="rsp-final__actions"><a class="btn btn--lg" href="/contact/?intent=response">Discuss a Response Sprint <span>→</span></a><a href="/competitor-brief/">Start from the Decision Sprint →</a></div></div><aside><small class="mono">BEST WHEN</small><b>The team knows the competitive problem.</b><p>What is missing is the market-facing response.</p></aside></div></section>

  <main class="rsp-final">
    <section class="section rsp-final__fit"><div class="container-wide rsp-final__split"><div><span class="label">THE JOB</span><h2>Research becomes usable market action.</h2><p>A Response Sprint starts from a defined competitive problem. It is for teams that need assets people can actually use in sales, pricing, positioning or messaging — not another research document.</p></div><div class="rsp-final__formula"><span>VERIFIED EVIDENCE</span><i>+</i><span>DECISION</span><i>→</i><strong>RESPONSE ASSETS</strong></div></div></section>

    <section class="section rsp-final__scope"><div class="container-wide"><header><span class="label">POSSIBLE SCOPE</span><h2>Built around the response the team needs.</h2></header><div class="rsp-final__cards"><article><b>01</b><h3>Battlecards</h3><p>Competitor-specific guidance grounded in verified differences and bounded claims.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Objection handling</h3><p>Response language for comparisons and objections appearing in live deals.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Pricing response</h3><p>Packaging, pricing story and value-justification options where pressure is visible.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h3>Positioning</h3><p>Sharper differentiation around evidence-supported areas that matter to the buyer.</p></article><article><b>05</b><h3>Messaging architecture</h3><p>Claims, proof points and boundaries that can travel across sales and marketing.</p></article><article><b>06</b><h3>Enablement</h3><p>Assets plus an executive view of what changed, why it matters and how to respond.</p></article></div></div></section>

    <section class="section rsp-final__standard" data-surface="dark"><div class="container-wide rsp-final__split"><div><span class="label">THE EVIDENCE STANDARD FOLLOWS THE RESPONSE</span><h2>Useful does not mean unsupported.</h2><p>Facts remain sourced. Strategic interpretation remains labeled. Unsupported assertions do not become sales copy simply because they sound useful.</p><a href="/method/">See the Evidence Axis method →</a></div><aside class="rsp-final__commercial"><small class="mono">ENGAGEMENT</small><strong>{offers.responseSprint.priceDisplay}</strong><p>{offers.responseSprint.priceNote}.</p><small class="mono">DELIVERY</small><b>{offers.responseSprint.delivery}</b></aside></div></section>

    <section class="section rsp-final__cta"><div class="container rsp-final__cta-inner"><span class="label">RESPOND</span><h2>Bring the decision. We’ll scope the response.</h2><p>Tell us what needs to change in sales, pricing, positioning, messaging or enablement.</p><a class="btn btn--lg" href="/contact/?intent=response">Discuss a Response Sprint <span>→</span></a><a class="rsp-final__email" href={`mailto:${contact.emailDisplay}`}>{contact.emailDisplay}</a></div></section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
.rsp-final{background:#f8f5ef}.rsp-final__hero{background:#030914;color:#f4f8ff;padding:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,4.8rem) 0}.rsp-final__hero-grid,.rsp-final__split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem);align-items:center}.rsp-final__hero h1,.rsp-final h2{margin:.55rem 0 .8rem;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5vw,5.2rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.052em}.rsp-final__hero p{max-width:52rem;color:#b8c8db;line-height:1.65;font-size:1.04rem}.rsp-final__hero aside{padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(111,160,219,.18);border-radius:.85rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)}.rsp-final__hero aside small{color:#efb269;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.1em}.rsp-final__hero aside b{display:block;margin:.45rem 0;font-size:1.25rem}.rsp-final__hero aside p{font-size:.86rem;margin:0;color:#8fa5bf}.rsp-final__actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1.3rem}.rsp-final__actions>a:not(.btn),.rsp-final__standard a{color:#f1bc78;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.rsp-final__fit{background:#fff}.rsp-final__fit p,.rsp-final__scope p,.rsp-final__cta p{color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.65}.rsp-final__formula{display:grid;gap:.65rem;padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(31,58,87,.12);border-radius:.85rem;background:#f6f8fa;font:800 .72rem/1.3 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.07em}.rsp-final__formula i{font-style:normal;color:#75869a}.rsp-final__formula strong{color:#a7642b}.rsp-final__scope{background:#f3eee6}.rsp-final__scope header{max-width:64rem}.rsp-final__cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.7rem;margin-top:1.3rem}.rsp-final__cards article{padding:1rem;border:1px solid rgba(31,58,87,.12);border-radius:.75rem;background:#fff}.rsp-final__cards b{font:800 .56rem/1 var(--font-mono);color:#b46b2d}.rsp-final__cards h3{margin:.5rem 0 .3rem}.rsp-final__cards p{margin:0;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.5}.rsp-final__standard{background:#030914;color:#f4f8ff}.rsp-final__standard p{color:#9fb2c9;line-height:1.65}.rsp-final__commercial{padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(115,164,219,.17);border-radius:.85rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);display:grid;gap:.35rem}.rsp-final__commercial small{color:#7f95b0;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-top:.5rem}.rsp-final__commercial strong{font-size:1.55rem}.rsp-final__commercial p{margin:0;font-size:.85rem}.rsp-final__cta{background:#fff}.rsp-final__cta-inner{max-width:64rem;text-align:center}.rsp-final__cta-inner p{max-width:45rem;margin:.8rem auto 1.1rem}.rsp-final__email{display:block;margin-top:1rem;color:#8b5b34;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:860px){.rsp-final__hero-grid,.rsp-final__split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rsp-final__cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.rsp-final__cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rsp-final__actions{display:grid}.rsp-final__actions a{width:100%}}
</style>
